  "description": "Truncated SVD and non-negative matrix factorization for .NET at scikit-learn parity, over a sparse matrix and without centring it: latent semantic analysis on a term-document matrix, with explained variance, and NMF for a parts-based decomposition. Randomized SVD with all three power-iteration normalizers; the dense kernels are written here, so the only dependency is Lodestar.Abstractions.",
